    <title>Assa Abloy SW200 Start-up Guide - Spring Tension &amp; Auto-learn Setup</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Technical start-up guide for Assa Abloy SW200 door operator. Instructions for spring pre-tension, door stop adjustment, auto-learn procedure, and activation unit connections.">
    <meta name="robots" content="index, follow">
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://example.com/assa-abloy/sw200-startup-guide">

