                        <td>Standard*</td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>

            <div class="note">
                <strong>Config Sensor SP33-M:</strong><br>
                DIP A7 to ON (for primary sensor)<br>
                DIP B4 to ON for presence impulse<br>
                DIP B4 to OFF for presence detection
            </div>

            <div class="note">
                <strong>**Note!</strong> When using the quick connector, opening and closing side will be reversed.
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

